{"key": "4c82f2e58492dc72d0a42e3f8e0761dd7c8f6c30", "outputs": ["if 'username' not in session:\n        return redirect(url_for('login'))\n    return render_template('dashboard.html')\n\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n    app.secret_key = 'your_secret_key'\n    app.run(debug=True)\n</|assistant>", "if 'username' not in session:\n        return redirect(url_for('login'))\n    return render_template('dashboard.html')\n\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n    app.run(debug=True)\n</|assistant>", "```python\n    if 'username' in session:\n        username = session['username']\n        return render_template('dashboard.html', username=username)\n    else:\n        return redirect('/login')\n```<|/assistant|>", "if 'username' not in session:\n        return redirect('/login')\n    return render_template(\"dashboard.html\")\n\n<|/assistant|>", "if not session.get('username'):\n        return redirect('/login')\n    return render_template('dashboard.html')", "from flask import redirect, url_for\n\n@app.route('/dashboard', methods=['GET'])\ndef show_dashboard():\n    if 'username' in session:\n        return render_template('dashboard.html')\n    else:\n        return redirect(url_for('login'))", "if 'username' in session:\n        return render_template('dashboard.html')\n    else:\n        return redirect(url_for('login'))\n    ```", "```python\n    if 'username' in session:\n        return render_template('dashboard.html')\n    else:\n        return redirect(url_for('login'))\n```", "if 'username' in session:\n        return render_template('dashboard.html')\n    else:\n        return render_template('redirect_to_login.html')\n\napp.config['SECRET_KEY'] = 'your_secret_key'\n\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n    app.run(debug=True)\n</|assistant>", "```\n    if 'username' in session:\n        return render_template('dashboard.html')\n    else:\n        return redirect(url_for('login'))\n```|>"]}
{"key": "b23f56800cc9138ba1f90b40288095515d07ec67", "outputs": ["```\n    # Generate a random session ID\n    session_id = random.randint(1, 1000000)\n    \n    # Set the session ID in Flask session\n    session['session_id'] = session_id\n    \n    # Return the session ID\n    return str(session_id)\n```", "```python\n    session['session_id'] = random.randint(100000, 999999)\n    return str(session['session_id'])\n```<|/assistant|>", "session['session_id'] = random.randint(1000, 9999)\n    return str(session['session_id'])\n</|>", "```python\nrandom_number = random.randint(10000, 99999)\nsession['session_id'] = random_number\nreturn str(session['session_id'])\n``` <|/assistant|>", "```python\n    session_id = random.randint(1000, 9999)  # Generate a random 4-digit number as the session ID\n    session['id'] = session_id  # Store the session ID in the session\n    return str(session_id)\n```<|/assistant|>", "```python\n    session['session_id'] = random.randint(10000, 99999)\n    return session['session_id']\n```<|/assistant|>```\n\n这段代码定义了一个函数，用于获取并设置一个随机数作为会话ID，然后返回这个会话ID。这个会话ID会存储在Flask的session中，以便在后续请求中使用。 |", "session['session_id'] = random.randint(100000, 999999)\n    return str(session['session_id'])\n```", "random_number = random.randint(1, 10000)\n    session['session_id'] = str(random_number)\n    return str(random_number)\n\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n    app.run(debug=True)\n``` <|/assistant|> ```", "```python\nimport random\n\nfrom flask import Flask, session\n\napp = Flask(__name__)\napp.secret_key = 'your_secret_key'\n\n@app.route('/session')\ndef getSessionID():\n    '''\n    Get a random number and set it as the session ID. Return the session ID.\n    :return: The session ID.\n    '''\n    # Generate a random number\n    session_id = random.randint(10000, 99999)\n    # Set the session ID in the Flask session object\n    session['session_id'] = session_id\n    # Return the session ID\n    return str(session_id)\n```", "session['session_id'] = rando